Bounded opt-in audio output trace for AUDIT-01 transition underruns.
GOW_AUDIO_TRACE=1 records reset/publication identity, producer age and
callback wait/deficit timing under the existing output mutex. No new callback
logging or allocation; explicit post-join audio shutdown flushes before main
uses _Exit. Destructor dump remains idempotent. Diagnostic only; no buffering
or resampling change or performance gain claim.
Validation: full verify (18 CTest groups and VU1 differential/replay checks),
traced mixer regression and a 120-second visible smoke passed all 12 gates.
Transition undersupply remains; see AUDIO-01 for measured limits.

